    "updated_at": "2023-06-26T13:09:00Z",
    "body": "In terms of naming, `response.assertOk()` might make more sense, to avoid the 'not'.\r\n\r\nI think the trick here is to make the error message useful to reporting systems. I know error text isn't usually spec'd, but it seems like the error message should include the `status` and `statusText`.",
